{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumUnconditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumUnconditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumClosure","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.HconvConventionBridge"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumUnconditional.molienSum_eq_qFactorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumUnconditional.molienSum_eq_qFactorial","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/NormalizedSumUnconditional.lean#L45-L51","doc":"**The general-`n` Molien / fake-degree identity** `molienSum n q = [n]_q!`, unconditionally\n(for `1 < q`) — i.e. `Σ_{λ⊢n} f^λ · q^{−κ_λ} · qDim_q(λ) = [n]_q!`. The headline consequence of\n`normalizedSum_eq_one` via `molienSum_eq_qFactorial_iff`, whose docstring records this as the open\ncontent of `qou-3quc` that it \"does not close, it locates\". Now closed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumUnconditional.normalizedSum_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.NormalizedSumUnconditional.normalizedSum_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/NormalizedSumUnconditional.lean#L29-L43","doc":"**`normalizedSum n q = 1`, unconditionally** (for `1 < q`). The general-`n` q-analogue fake-degree\nidentity, closed via the corpus general-X Macdonald telescope at `X = 0` and the convention bridge\n`hconv` — the whole of `qou-3quc`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}